  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n +\n ÷\n -\n ×\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ×\n -\n ÷\n +\n \n \n\nGiven: 150 × 25 - 5 ÷ 10 + 2 = ?\n\n150 × 25 - 5 ÷ 10 + 2 = ? ⇒ 150 + 25 ÷ 5 - 10 × 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 150 + __**25 **____**÷**____** 5**__ - 10 × 2 = ?\n\n⇒ 150 + 5 - __**10 **____**×**____** 2**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __**150 + **____**5**__ - 20 = ?\n\n⇒ __**155 - 20**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 135 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
